Aerie-Purpose: Make TestingBrowserProcess match Helium's BrowserProcess, which has no Safe Browsing service and no speech recognition model installer.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/test/base/testing_browser_process.{h,cc} (test-only code)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Helium turns SAFE_BROWSING_AVAILABLE off, so BrowserProcess no longer declares
safe_browsing_service() and the testing subclass must not either. It also drops
speech_recognition_small_expert_model_installer(); the testing getter stays, but
is no longer an override. Test-only: nothing in the shipped browser links it. Issue #175.

--- a/chrome/test/base/testing_browser_process.h
